@startuml
!includeurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/refs/heads/main/proveo.iuml
title Mentat — context-pruning coding assistant (OUTDATED)
' Product: Mentat (AbanteAI CLI)
' URL: https://github.com/AbanteAI/archive-old-cli-mentat
' Level: 4
' Status: OUTDATED as of 2026-09. AbanteAI marks the CLI drawn here "ARCHIVED / no longer maintained
'         or supported", and states the Mentat name is now used by a different project — a hosted
'         GitHub bot. mentat.ai was unreachable when checked, so the archived repo is cited instead
'         as the verifiable source for the architecture actually depicted.

package "Mentat Architecture" {
    [Conversation Manager] as MGR
    [Code Context] as CTX
    [LLM API] as API
    [Git Interface] as GIT
    [Parser/Diff Engine] as DIFF
}

MGR --> CTX : "Prune Context (Token Limit)"
MGR ---> API : "Stream Response"
MGR --> GIT : "Apply Changes"
CTX --> DIFF : "Parse/Rank Files"

note right of MGR
  Dynamically prunes context
  based on token limits.
end note
@enduml
